<!-- P23 adaptive-icon foreground: the same two-opposing-arrows "relay"
     glyph as the bottom-navigation Transfers icon (src/components/icons.tsx),
     scaled onto the 108x108dp adaptive-icon canvas and kept within the
     ~66dp safe zone so no launcher mask clips it.
